---
title: "5.4.3 Sequence — terbitkan release"
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor PL as Pelanggan<br/>(editor)
  participant API as API<br/>/v1/sites
  participant DB as Postgres<br/>(sites, releases)
  participant WK as Worker<br/>(build release)
  participant R2 as R2 + edge<br/>(Worker Sites)
  PL->>+API: POST publishes + Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: Cek periode dan kuota website
  API->>DB: Bekukan revisi
  API->>DB: Release queued + outbox site.publish
  API-->>-PL: 202 + id pekerjaan
  DB->>+WK: outbox site.publish
  WK->>R2: Tulis HTML statis + JSON-LD ke prefix baru
  Note over WK: Validasi skema, aset, tautan, anggaran berat
  alt validasi lolos
    WK->>DB: CAS active_release_id bila desired masih sama
    WK->>R2: Purge cache (site_id)
    WK->>DB: site.published + audit
  else gagal
    WK->>DB: Release failed, release aktif tetap
  end
  deactivate WK
  loop sampai ready atau failed
    PL->>API: GET /v1/jobs/{id}
    API-->>PL: Status pekerjaan
  end
